cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Reproducible Analysis Code for L-DEP-PD-1 Induction Therapy in EBV-Positive Lymphoma-Associated Hemophagocytic Lymphohistiocytosis"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Yubo
    family-names: Pi
    affiliation: "Department of Hematology, Beijing Friendship Hospital, Capital Medical University, Beijing, China"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-8971-5517"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible analysis code accompanying a prospective, multicentre,
  single-arm Phase 2 study of L-DEP-PD-1 induction therapy for
  Epstein-Barr virus (EBV)-positive lymphoma-associated hemophagocytic
  lymphohistiocytosis (LA-HLH). The repository contains scripts for data
  preparation and statistical analysis used to reproduce the quantitative
  results reported in the associated manuscript, including treatment
  response, EBV-DNA kinetics, paired laboratory parameter comparisons,
  adverse-event summaries, and Kaplan-Meier overall survival analysis.
keywords:
  - EBV-positive LA-HLH
  - lymphoma-associated hemophagocytic lymphohistiocytosis
  - L-DEP-PD-1
  - camrelizumab
  - asparaginase
  - reproducible analysis
license: "CC-BY-4.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Yubo-Pi/LDEP-PD-1_LA-HLH"
